A column-0 line after a container's last block, when that block left no paragraph open

```
- # H
tail
.
<ul>
  <li>
    <h1 id="H">H</h1>
  </li>
</ul>
<p>tail</p>
```

```
> # H
tail
.
<blockquote>
  <h1 id="H">H</h1>
</blockquote>
<p>tail</p>
```

```
- | a | b |
tail
.
<ul>
  <li>
    <table>
      <tbody>
        <tr><td>a</td><td>b</td></tr>
      </tbody>
    </table>
  </li>
</ul>
<p>tail</p>
```

